{"id":"homo","lemma":"homo","pos":"adj","rank":2835,"glosses":["gay, homo"],"ipa":"/ɔ.mo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-homo.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-homo.wav.mp3","forms":{"plural":"homos"},"formAudio":{"homos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-anti-homos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les meilleurs coiffeurs sont homos.","en":"The best hairdressers are gay.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"best, better","l":"meilleur"},{"g":"hairdresser","l":"coiffeur"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Il vient de s'avouer homo.","en":"It just came out.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to admit, to confess"},null]},{"text":"Une amie à moi aime se rendre dans les bars homos avec moi.","en":"A female friend of mine loves to go to gay bars with me.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"friend"},null,null,{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to return"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"bar","l":"bar"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"me"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"help!"]]},{"text":"Si vous vous faites percer l'oreille droite, cela signifie que vous êtes homo.","en":"If you get your right ear pierced, that means you're gay.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to pierce"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ear"},{"g":"right"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to signify, mean","l":"signifier"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Si tu te fais percer l'oreille droite, cela signifie que tu es homo.","en":"If you get your right ear pierced, that means you're gay.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"to pierce"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"ear"},{"g":"right"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to signify, mean","l":"signifier"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},null]}]}